	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gratiam et pacem.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Immortales tibi, vir clarissime, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>gratias habeo, qui me libello<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Wahrscheinlich handelt es sich um ein von <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> bereits erbetenes Exemplar der [Ersten] <placeName ref="l28">Basler</placeName> Konfession vom Januar 1534, s. oben <ref target="file10350">[Nr. 319]</ref> S. 51, Anm. 22 und S. 57,2-7. <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> ordnete es in seine Dokumentation zum Abendmahlsstreit ein, s. unten S 369f, Anm. a.</note> donaris et tam amice respon<lb xml:id="p1z3"/>deris<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Oben <ref target="file10357">Nr. 326</ref>.</note>.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Perge, obsecro, semper benefacere.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Quae de <placeName ref="l213">Hesso</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>et <placeName ref="l832">Gallo</placeName>, legatione quoque <placeName ref="l18">Augustana</placeName> mones<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Vgl. oben S. 64, 5-14.</note>, supra <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>quam dici potest, obturba[n]t<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a"><hi>In der Vorlage</hi> obturpat.</note>.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Vereor <placeName ref="l832">Gallicam</placeName> subesse technam.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z6"/>Pontifex hactenus non potuit in exitium <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>nostrum provocare caesarem, quod princeps sit non omnino <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>malus.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Quid, si hac arte caesarea arma et in <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>principes et urbes christianas provocaret?</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Pontifex <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>hoc unum cogitat, quomodo religionem excindat.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><pb type="edition" next="68"/><placeName ref="l832">Gallus</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>hoc unum cogitat, quomodo <placeName ref="l306">Mediolano</placeName> et <placeName ref="l994">Neapolis</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>regno potiatur.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Diversi sunt huius tragoediae ca<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>tastrophe<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Wohl griechischer Dativ («bei der entscheidenden Wendung des Trauerspiels»).</note>.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Nulla fides in principibus.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Quisque <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>rem suam quaerit.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Pontifex cogitat: Si per <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>amicitiam <placeName ref="l832">Galli</placeName> et <placeName ref="l822">Germanorum</placeName> <placeName ref="l822">Germanis</placeName> in<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>fensum redderes caesarem, vicisses.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Iam etsi <placeName ref="l832">Gallus</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>una periret, conciliares te caesari quam minimo, <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>utpote homini facili et clementi.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l832">Gallus</placeName> cogitat: <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>Si tu pontificis et <placeName ref="l822">Germanorum</placeName> opera poti<lb xml:id="p1z20"/>reris <placeName ref="l306">Mediolano</placeName> et <placeName ref="l994">Neapoli</placeName>, deinde ne pontificem <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>quidem vel <placeName ref="l822">Germanos</placeName> huius aestimaris.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">In<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>fensus est caesar.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Imperium ambit <placeName ref="l832">Gallus</placeName>, de <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>iniuria papiensi se ulcisci cogitat, breviter <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>caesarem extinctum cupit.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Haec principes et <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>urbes<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Nämlich die <placeName ref="l822">deutschen</placeName> Kurfürsten und Reichsstädte.</note> non vident vel videre nolunt, fidem <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>caesari datam violant, proinde carbones in <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>capita sua congerunt<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6"><cit type="bible"><ref>Röm 12, 20</ref></cit> (zitiert <cit type="bible"><ref>Spr 25, 22</ref></cit>).</note>.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Videbis, frater dilectissime, <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>nos brevi contempti evangelii, sanguinis <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>rusticani effusi poenas daturos<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b"><hi>In der Vorlage irrtümlich</hi> daturum.</note>.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">An<lb xml:id="p1z30"/>non pudenda res, quod intestina bella <lb xml:id="p1z31"/><placeName ref="l832">Galli</placeName> gratia in <placeName ref="l822">Germaniam</placeName> suscipimus<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7">Gemeint sind die Kriegsvorbereitungen von <persName ref="p3590">Philipp von Hessen</persName> vor der Wiedereinsetzung von <persName ref="p9708">Herzog Ulrich</persName> in <placeName ref="l572">Württemberg</placeName>, vgl. <bibl source="b690">Wille</bibl> 145-171.</note>, cum <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>pace frui liceret?</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Quis offendit aut <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>opprimit urbes?</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Annon libere crediderunt <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>hactenus?</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Annon caesaris quoque praesidio egere <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>in pace?</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Sed ita maturat vindicta dom<lb xml:id="p1z36"/>ini<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Röm 12, 19</ref></cit>.</note>.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Utinam vanus <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>sim vates.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="de">Es ist <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>ghein trüw nienan<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" ana="lex" n="9">nirgends.</note> me.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale et ora <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>sedulo dominum, nobis adsit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="de">23. februarii 1534.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salvum volo communem <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>patrem nostrum<note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">Bürgermeister <persName ref="p8129">Jakob Meyer zum Hirzen</persName>.</note>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p495">Hein.</persName> t<lb xml:id="p1z42"/>uus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Ornatissimo viro d. <persName ref="p8418">Osvaldo <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Myconio</persName>, <placeName ref="l28">Basileiensis</placeName> ecclesiae <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>ministro, fratri charissimo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
